</span></span><span role=status x-text="message.copied ? 'Copied!' : 'Copy'">Copy</span></button></div><p role=status class=text-xs x-text="message.copyError || ''"></p><template x-if=message.feedbackError><div x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200" x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 translate-y-1" x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0" role=alert class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-(--color-destructive-ink)"><span x-text=message.feedbackError></span></div></template></div></template></div></div></template></div><template x-if=error><div class="rounded-lg border border-(--color-edge) bg-(--color-destructive-subtle) p-4 text-(--color-destructive-subtle-foreground)"><p class=text-sm x-text=error></p></div></template><template x-if=shouldShowCountdown()><div class="rounded-lg border border-(--color-edge) bg-(--color-warning-subtle) p-3 text-(--color-warning-subtle-foreground)"><p class=text-sm><span x-text=getRemainingTurns()></span>
